# --- CIW text size ----------------------------------------------------------
# The CIW is where every notice, echo and command result lands, and it ships at
# Monospace 10 -- small enough on a large or HiDPI display that the pane gets
# skimmed instead of read. Bump it 20% (10 -> 12) for the Cadence-style workarea.
# `ciw_set_font_size`, not `set ciw_font_size`: this rc is sourced AFTER
# ciw_create has already built the window, so only the setter (which reconfigures
# the live named font) reaches it. See src/ciw.tcl.
catch {ciw_set_font_size 12}
